+  - Exposed slow-query snapshots at `/metrics` under `data.slow_queries` and updated OpenAPI route metadata.
+  - Added structured slow-query warning logs that include duration/threshold and correlation hints while omitting SQL text, bind args, table names, DSNs, and driver error strings.
+  - Updated operator documentation and module AGENTS guidance for the slow-query signal.
